From 50de1a18f215bbd1737c069d75514e6764097ef7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Feb 2026 14:56:54 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 2428/5749] feat(hooks): add hashline-edit-diff-enhancer for
 TUI inline diff display

Capture file content before hashline edit execution and compute filediff
metadata after, enabling opencode TUI to render inline diffs for the
plugin's edit tool (which replaces the built-in EditTool).
